title: "RealityGate: prove what your AI coding agent built is real"
abstract: "An open-source CLI, Claude Code plugin and GitHub Action that scores AI-generated codebases (Reality Score), fails builds on fake code, hallucinated packages and leaked secrets, proves its own checks can fail with planted canaries, and provides a spec-driven Build OS, with six subagents, that takes a solo founder from a software requirements specification (SRS) to a shipped MVP."
